</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Schmidt</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudland</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of hyperplasias, preneoplasias, and mammary tumors in MMTV-c-erbB-2 and MMTV-TGFalpha transgenic rats</article-title><source>Am J Pathol</source><year>1999</year><volume>155</volume><fpage>303</fpage><lpage>314</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Am J Pathol||155|303||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10393862</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Davies</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Harris</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudland</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Barraclough</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expression of the rat, S-100-related, calcium-binding protein gene, p9Ka, in transgenic mice demonstrates different patterns of expression between these two species</article-title><source>DNA Cell Biol</source><year>1995</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>825</fpage><lpage>832</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'DNA Cell Biol||14|825||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7546288</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Davies</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Rudland</surname><given-names>PS</given-names></name><name><surname>Robertson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Parry</surname><given-names>EW</given-names></name><name><surname>Jolicoeur</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Barraclough</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Expression of the calcium-binding protein S100A4 (p9Ka) in MMTV-neu transgenic mice induces metastasis of mammary